{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e1a9d6006945d2800156","chatId":"f30294ad9f4445979840d7a11fa3794b","sessionId":null,"userId":56262,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[C]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[C]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":891,"promptTokens":1566,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:53"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008577487441202876,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1a9d6006945d2800155","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367913655,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:53","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e1a9d6006945d2800155","chatId":"f30294ad9f4445979840d7a11fa3794b","sessionId":null,"userId":56262,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n小玲的室友是一个总是把家务事情推给她的人，一直依赖着小玲的照顾。小玲真的受不了了，她对异地的老公说：“我真的受够你我那舍友了，她总是让我干所有的清洁工作，我想重新租个房子。” 其实，她的老公也知道小玲和她舍友的相处情况，但为了不想花钱重新租个房子，他笑着说：“或许你只是需要换个角度看待，或许你的舍友把你当做好姐妹才能这样的。不要太过于焦虑，毕竟生活中总会有一些挑战。”\n\n[问题]\n小玲的老公为什么这么说？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 小玲的老公认为小玲过于焦虑，不应该对家务事情感到过度压力。\nB. 她试图鼓励小玲继续承担家务，因为他认为她更擅长处理这些事情。\nC. 小玲的老公为了说服小玲继续在那里住，故意说舍友把她看做好姐妹。\nD. 小玲的老公认为小玲应该找一个新室友，避免为家务事情过多操劳。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008577487441202876,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1a9d6006945d2800156","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367913652,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:53","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ed2896f982c7435093418aaca1bb5636"}